{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 24, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a plan for Japan a journey grand\nA sylvan tour across this wondrous land.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth alight\nIn Tokyo's port a dazzling wondrous sight.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy carriage shall proceed\nWhere neon glow doth plant a vibrant seed.\nA humble inn shall be thy nightly keep\nTo rest thy weary soul and slumber deep.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Ancient Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall make haste\nWhere Senso-ji's bells their holy song embrace.\nThrough Nakamise-dori's stalls we'll stroll\nFor trinkets treats and treasures for the soul.\nThen to the Imperial Palace we'll roam\nAnd witness history in this regal home.\n\n**Day Three: Harajuku's Fashion Flair**\n\nIn Harajuku's streets a vibrant show\nOf youthful style and fashions all aglow.\nTakeshita Street a bustling lively place\nWhere quirky trends do meet with smiling face.\nThen Meiji Jingu a tranquil wood we'll find\nTo leave the city's clamor far behind.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Mountain View**\n\nTo Hakone's hills our journey now extends\nWhere Mount Fuji's peak majestically ascends.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi serene and blue\nWith views of nature fresh and ever new.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum we'll see\nWhere sculptures dance for all eternity.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Imperial Heart**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we shall fly\nA city steeped in history reaching high.\nTo Gion's district we shall gently tread\nWhere geishas glide and ancient tales are read.\nKiyomizu-dera Temple's wooden stage\nA breathtaking view across a bygone age.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion's Gleam**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor doth enthrall\nA golden vision answering beauty's call.\nRyoan-ji's Zen garden calm and deep\nWhere stones and raked sand secrets softly keep.\nNijo Castle's grandeur we shall explore\nAnd hear of shoguns power evermore.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer Park Delight**\n\nTo Nara we journey a short space hence\nWhere friendly deer display their innocence.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha's might\nA wondrous statue bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine with lanterns bright\nA sacred place a truly wondrous sight.\n\n**Day Eight: Osaka's Culinary Feast**\n\nTo Osaka's kitchens we shall now arrive\nWhere culinary delights will keep us alive.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant scene\nWith street food vendors ever keen.\nOsaka Castle a fortress strong and bold\nA tale of samurai bravely told.\n\n**Day Nine: Farewell Japan**\n\nWith heavy hearts we bid this land adieu\nMemories made forever fresh and new.\nFrom bustling cities to serene retreats\nJapan's beauty forever shall repeat\nWithin our minds a treasure we shall hold\nA story whispered brave and ever bold.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.661582589149475}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0020667400676757097}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.051429785788059235}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.013251214288175106}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.29497048258781433}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.06565017998218536}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0007540719816461205}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.20183058083057404}, {"token": "▁s", "logprob": -3.256591320037842}, {"token": "ylvan", "logprob": -0.4513833522796631}, {"token": "▁tour", "logprob": -1.7364130020141602}, {"token": "▁across", "logprob": -0.5192182660102844}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -0.17610442638397217}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.31986331939697266}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.055108193308115005}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0005691815749742091}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.04902873560786247}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.009338862262666225}, {"token": "▁One", "logpr